    "why": "Top-down processing originates in the brain, at the top of the perceptual system. It is also called knowledge-driven processing. The perceiver brings knowledge, which is what you already know about Mary. The perceiver brings expectation, which is what you predict you are about to see. The perceiver brings attention, which decides which features are sampled."
